"""
Binance Futures Telegram Signal Bot PRO
--------------------------------------
Public Binance USD-M Futures data only. No trading or API keys required.

Features:
- Per-chat /time 5M|15M|30M|1H|4H
- Per-chat /leaderboard N (top N USDT perpetuals by 24h quote volume)
- Per-chat manual /tokens BTC ETH SOL and /tokens auto
- Multi-timeframe trend (1m/5m/15m/1h/4h)
- CVD / taker flow from recent aggregate trades
- Advanced OI + price context, funding, long/short ratio
- Order-book imbalance and spread filter
- Approximate candle-based Volume Profile (POC/VAH/VAL)
- Recent forced-liquidation activity where Binance endpoint permits it
- Signal expiry and outcome tracking in SQLite
- /stats and /status

Important limitations:
- Binance's public REST API does not provide a full liquidation heatmap. This bot
  reports recent forced-order activity and must not label it a complete heatmap.
- Candle-based Volume Profile is an approximation, not exchange tick-level volume-at-price.
- Probabilities are heuristic model scores, NOT statistically validated probabilities.
  Backtest and paper-trade before relying on them.
"""

